                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A扶额无奈}没错，算是个熟人，可以这么说。\n更准确一点应该是，熟客。\n以前他雇我带过几次找宝藏的队伍……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203203301_2900038054_content",
                "value": "{A扶额无奈}没错，算是个熟人，可以这么说。\n更准确一点应该是，熟客。\n以前他雇我带过几次找宝藏的队伍……",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
